OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CToday:FExtensive cloud and hill fog    
OL,6,Fduring the morning. Rain moves in from 
OL,7,Fthe southwest by mid-day to affect     
OL,8,Fmost areas and may turn heavy at       
OL,9,Ftimes. Strong winds along the coast    
OL,10,Fand over high ground may reach gale    
OL,11,Fforce.                                 
OL,13,CTonight:FRain and cloud clear          
OL,14,Fovernight, with clear spells to        
OL,15,Ffollow. The wind also eases allowing   
OL,16,Ftemperatures to fall and a frost to    
OL,17,Fform.                                  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
