OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CSunday:FA clear start to the day with  
OL,6,Fmany seeing some morning sunshine.     
OL,7,FHowever, a band of heavy and blustery  
OL,8,Fshowers moves in by mid-day. Brighter  
OL,9,Fand drier spells to follow.            
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FWindy 
OL,12,Fwith cloudy periods on Monday, rain    
OL,13,Fmostly over hills, drier along the     
OL,14,Fcoast. Wet and windy start to Tuesday, 
OL,15,Fdrier later. Partly cloudy but         
OL,16,Fremaining mostly dry on Wednesday.     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
